<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices- Jan 29.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices- Jan 29.</headline>
<text>
<p>DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    91/93     98/99	UNQ     186/192</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	   97/100   105/107   198/200   205/210</p>
<p>-------- COMMENTS - Bunkers prices were steady late Wednesday, tracking cargo levels. Demand was thin as most shipowners were sidelined. &quot;I expected cargo levels to fall but they were steady today,&quot; said a shipowner. Sellers were waiting for prices to climb before quoting, traders said.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3082)</p>
